t(16, 125, """We turned humans into mice .. We made most humans employees in the private sector .. and we made the private sector an entity with its own laws, in which the state does not interfere or rule .. We launched the era of the private sector .. the era of slavery anew .. a real era of slavery .. We will exploit the men, giving them the lowest salaries, and we will wear out their bodies so that their family and social lives are ruined .. We will keep them afraid 24 hours .. tense .. The salary is not enough .. Responsibilities will grow because they will have children .. We will exploit the woman .. We will redefine the slavery of woman anew, in a manner elegant and pleasant in its outward form .. We will smash the social order .. we will crush it .. We will change the mind of the woman and the mind of the man .. New generations will grow up seeing the mother commit many wrongs in order to keep her job .. and generations will grow up seeing the father and mother in constant struggle .. in daily quarrel .. lost for a whole lifetime .. Then we will break up the families .. We will smash the family system .. and we will build a deformed world .. lost .. possessing no strength of its own .. afraid .. trembling all the time .. its spirit never calm .. its soul feeling nothing of tranquillity .. We will make humans our property .. We will capture them and enslave them .. The media will ally with us to change people's minds .. The media will present them a new pattern of the meaning of a decent life .. The media will tell them that all secondary things are essentials .. The essentials will multiply .. The list of essentials will swell in people's minds .. The bill will swell .. The crumbs we throw them will not cover the new swollen list .. They will become more corrupt .. They will sell morals more .. They will slaughter values and standards on the altar of imitation .. So-and-so has a good car that does not break down .. So-and-so owns a flat .. So-and-so's children study in London .. So-and-so travels every year to the most expensive cities .. We will distort man's thinking .. We will enslave him .. The private sector will be the slave market .. its managers will be the slave traders .. and the platform for displaying male and female slaves in the market will be the job vacancy advertisement .. All this is true .. and real .. And I exempt from it every righteous man and woman among the oppressed and tormented, and every righteous man and woman among the business owners.""")

t(16, 1630, """1450 years ago the support of heaven was for the oppressed .. The support, by the power of our Lord, is coming once again""")

t(16, 2495, """Those who were born and the whisper in their ears never stopped, not even for a single moment .. a hidden whisper .. You must save the world .. Those who struck themselves with their own hands whenever they heard of a disaster that struck people in a war .. a calamity that befell people because of injustice and oppression .. Those in whose ears the whisper never stopped, not even for a day .. When will you save the world?""")

t(17, 60, """And they would answer the voice: What has it to do with us? But the voice does not leave them .. This picture is for you .. I know what befell you .. and I know that the voice was compulsory .. This is destiny .. You could not have escaped it however much the whisper wearied you .. You were being prepared psychologically, nothing more, to carry a heavy load at the end of an era in which the spirit of man was killed and what remained of his authenticity was finished off""")

